{
  "id": "form_tooling_level3",
  "difficulty": "level3",
  "prompt": "On the open Intake Tools dashboard, add Financial Entry Form and Example Backend Params from Widget Examples. Set daysPicker1 to 5 and leave the tester's other parameters at their defaults. Keep everything already there exactly as is. Under the widgets.json spec's Widget Parameters resource, leave an Intake Tooling Governance Note recording the parameter kind listed between endpoint and button.",
